# 🚀 Overview

Ashley Furniture Product Data Extraction is a **Python-based web scraping and browser automation project** developed as part of a Technical / Data Research Assignment.

The project focuses on processing **198 Ashley Furniture SKUs**, finding the corresponding product pages, validating the product SKU, extracting available product information, and saving the results into Excel.

---

# 🎯 Problem Statement

The provided Excel file contains **198 Ashley Furniture product SKUs**.

Manually searching each SKU and collecting product information can be time-consuming and may lead to data-entry errors.

The required information includes:

* SKU
* Product URL
* Image
* Description
* Color
* Price
* Series Name
* UPC
* Product Dimensions
* Carton Dimensions
* Other available product details

The goal is to automate this process as much as possible.

---

# 💡 Solution

A Selenium-based browser automation workflow was developed to search and collect product information from Ashley Furniture.

The automation performs the following steps:

```text
Excel File
    ↓
Read SKU
    ↓
Open Ashley Furniture
    ↓
Search SKU
    ↓
Find Product URL
    ↓
Open Product Page
    ↓
Validate SKU
    ↓
Extract Product Data
    ↓
Save to Excel
```

---

# ✨ Features

## 📊 Excel Processing

* Reads the provided Excel file
* Verifies 198 SKUs
* Processes SKU information
* Saves extracted results to Excel

## 🌐 Web Scraping

* Searches Ashley Furniture products
* Finds matching product URLs
* Opens product pages
* Extracts available product information

## 🤖 Browser Automation

* Selenium browser automation
* Chrome remote debugging
* Location popup handling
* Cookie popup handling
* Product-page navigation

## ✅ Data Validation

* Compares Excel SKU with website SKU
* Prevents incorrect product matching
* Records unavailable information as `N/A`

---

# 🔄 Extraction Workflow

```text
                    Excel SKU
                       │
                       ▼
                Ashley Furniture
                       │
                       ▼
                   SKU Search
                       │
                       ▼
                 Product URL
                       │
                       ▼
                 Product Page
                       │
                       ▼
                  SKU Validation
                       │
                       ▼
                Product Extraction
                       │
                       ▼
                  Excel Output
```

---

# 🧪 Test Results

The automation was successfully tested with sample SKUs.

### SKU Search Test

```text
SKU: R407681

Product URL:
https://www.ashleyfurniture.com/p/bachby_710_x_10_area_rug/R407681.html

Result: Successful
```

### Product Extraction Test

```text
SKU: A4000462

Product: Ryandale Accent Table
Price: $249.99
Rating: 4.8

Excel SKU:   A4000462
Website SKU: A4000462
SKU Match:   True
```

The extracted result was successfully saved to the Excel output file.

---

# ⚠️ Current Challenge

Initially, Python `requests` was used to access the Ashley Furniture product page.

The website returned:

```text
HTTP 406
```

Since the direct request did not provide useful page content, the approach was changed to Selenium browser automation.

During product-page navigation, Ashley Furniture sometimes displays:

```text
Press & Hold to confirm you are a human.
```

This interrupts continuous automated processing.

The human verification was not bypassed.

